{"title": "Regain Hit Points", "pageid": 34764, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Regain_Hit_Points", "categories": ["Class actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Regain_Hit_Points.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Regain_Hit_Points.webp/300px-Regain_Hit_Points.webp, /w/images/3/3e/Regain_Hit_Points.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Regain_Hit_Points.webp/300px-Regain_Hit_Points.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Regain_Hit_Points.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Regain Hit Points</b> is a class action available to most non-player characters. It lets them fully restore their hit points and resources outside of combat.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Fully restore <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">hit points</a> and spell slots outside of combat.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_RegainHP_Peace_NPC</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_RegainHP_Peace_NPC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_RegainHP_Peace_NPC\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Usage of this ability is not recorded in the combat log.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715064707\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1336/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8374/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2331/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 17/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 917087/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.505      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   36.505      1 -total\n 73.13%   26.697     18 Template:Trim\n 29.97%   10.940      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 20.33%    7.423      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 16.00%    5.841      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 10.88%    3.973      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.42%    3.803      